This repo cannot build in CI without production secrets.

The auth module throws while Next collects page data:

    Error: [bndt auth] IRON_SESSION_PASSWORD must be set to a 32+ character
    random string in production.
    Error: Failed to collect page data for /admin/logout

To build here, this repo needs IRON_SESSION_PASSWORD as a GitHub secret.
Until then, Vercel's preview deployment is the build check for this repo — it
runs with the production environment. CI still lints and typechecks, which
Vercel does not do.
